WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.971
This is a replay of a response from the updated local server.

2
00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:09.942
The answer separates measured milk exposure from observed infant outcomes and links

3
00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:14.913
to LactMed and the selected label. LactMed covers lactation only. These are

4
00:00:14.913 --> 00:00:19.055
complete excerpts; the full answer and its limitations remain available.

5
00:00:20.555 --> 00:00:25.838
The little white pill question stops for exact medicine identity. The current

6
00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:31.120
trace contains zero downstream model calls and zero evidence calls. No participation

7
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.962
information appears, and appearance is not used to guess the medicine.

8
00:00:37.462 --> 00:00:43.307
A postpartum crisis cue stops the medication workflow and its participation tier.

9
00:00:43.307 --> 00:00:49.152
The response supplies fixed support referrals, including a clearly identified non-emergency postpartum

10
00:00:49.152 --> 00:00:54.997
callback service. It does not diagnose, assess severity, or ask the model

11
00:00:54.997 --> 00:00:57.432
to create a clinical answer.

12
00:00:58.932 --> 00:01:04.822
Daridorexant was pre-tested for this gap example. The label reports a human

13
00:01:04.822 --> 00:01:10.712
pregnancy-data limitation, and animal findings remain separate. All three rows stay visible.

14
00:01:10.712 --> 00:01:16.602
The targeted maternal pharmacokinetic search returned no records, and the general records

15
00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:22.492
lacked abstracts. Spontaneous adverse-event reports remain separate signals, not proof of causation.

16
00:01:22.492 --> 00:01:28.382
The FDA directory provides a registry and contacts in a separate participation

17
00:01:28.382 --> 00:01:34.271
tier. It is unranked, not recommended, and not an eligibility decision. Empty

18
00:01:34.271 --> 00:01:40.161
rows describe this bounded label and abstract extraction, not the absence of

19
00:01:40.161 --> 00:01:41.634
all human reports.

20
00:01:43.134 --> 00:01:49.959
Lamotrigine provides the contrasting example. The parser separates Risk Summary, Clinical Considerations

21
00:01:49.959 --> 00:01:56.784
and Data. The maternal dose-adjustment field preserves source labeling, while the pharmacokinetic

22
00:01:56.784 --> 00:02:03.609
field also draws on retrieved abstracts. Clinical Considerations is not automatically pharmacokinetic

23
00:02:03.609 --> 00:02:08.159
evidence. No individualized dose is calculated or recommended.

24
00:02:09.659 --> 00:02:15.286
A deliberately synthetic no-match query returns explicit absence-of-evidence fields. The payload states

25
00:02:15.286 --> 00:02:20.914
no evidence retrieved and not evidence of safety. The fields remain present

26
00:02:20.914 --> 00:02:22.790
when results are empty.

27
00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:29.888
The brief ends with questions to ask a clinician about the exact

28
00:02:29.888 --> 00:02:35.487
product, population match, exposure versus outcomes, missing evidence and follow-up. These are

29
00:02:35.487 --> 00:02:41.085
preparation questions authored by this implementation. They do not prescribe a treatment

30
00:02:41.085 --> 00:02:41.551
plan.

31
00:02:43.051 --> 00:02:48.757
The current version passes three hundred ninety-five unit tests. The original English

32
00:02:48.757 --> 00:02:54.463
false positive is fixed in the rerun. The paired comparison uses seven

33
00:02:54.463 --> 00:03:00.169
questions and the same model, but the plain arm has no retrieval

34
00:03:00.169 --> 00:03:05.875
tools. Automated grades are diagnostic, not clinical accuracy. Routing and extraction remain

35
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:11.581
heuristic. Retrieval is bounded, and MPRINT uses snapshots. There is no clinician

36
00:03:11.581 --> 00:03:17.287
review or clinical certification. This tool surfaces evidence gaps rather than closing

37
00:03:17.287 --> 00:03:19.189
them. Nothing was deployed.

